&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;20&quot;&gt;What Is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;20&quot; data-end=&quot;23&quot;&gt;Elastic is looking for a driven, results-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to accelerate growth in Singapore. The ideal candidate is a proven hunter with a strong track record of acquiring new enterprise customers, building pipeline from the ground up, and closing complex technology deals with large organizations. This role is suited to a sales professional who thrives on winning new logos, breaking into strategic accounts, and establishing relationships with senior business and technology leaders. You will identify new market opportunities, develop compelling business cases, and position Elastic as a strategic technology partner to enterprise customers.&amp;nbsp;You will own the full sales cycle, from prospecting and qualifying opportunities to developing deal strategies, negotiating commercial agreements, and closing new business. While new customer acquisition is the primary focus, you will also identify opportunities to expand Elastic&#39;s footprint within existing accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acquire New Enterprise Customers:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, target, and win new enterprise logos in Singapore. Develop and execute a proactive territory strategy to penetrate strategic accounts and establish Elastic&#39;s presence in new customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Pipeline Through Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Generate qualified pipeline through disciplined outbound prospecting, executive networking, referrals, partner relationships, industry events, and other demand-generation activities. Maintain a strong pipeline of self-sourced opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Full Sales Cycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex enterprise sales engagements from initial discovery and qualification through solution development, business case creation, negotiation, and deal closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Executive Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Build trusted relationships with C-level executives, business leaders, and senior technology stakeholders. Understand their strategic priorities and connect Elastic&#39;s solutions to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Competitive Wins:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities to displace incumbent vendors, challenge the status quo, and introduce Elastic into new accounts. Develop compelling value propositions and differentiated sales strategies to win competitive opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Strategic Account Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Create actionable territory and account plans that identify target customers, buying centers, key stakeholders, whitespace opportunities, and clear paths to winning new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Complex Enterprise Deals:&lt;/strong&gt; Orchestrate cross-functional teams across solution architecture, product, professional services, marketing, and channel partners to advance opportunities and deliver successful customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Business Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate customer challenges into compelling business cases supported by value justification, ROI analysis, and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Partner-Led Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with channel partners, systems integrators, cloud providers, and strategic alliances to identify new opportunities, expand market reach, and accelerate customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Consistent Sales Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own pipeline creation, forecast accuracy, sales execution, and quota attainment. Maintain a disciplined approach to qualification, deal progression, and territory management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Elastic Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strong working knowledge of Elastic&#39;s Search AI, Observability, and Security solutions, and articulate their value to enterprise customers across different industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1852&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1852&quot; data-end=&quot;1870&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Hunter Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; A demonstrated track record of winning new enterprise customers, opening doors in target accounts, and building pipeline through proactive prospecting rather than relying primarily on inbound leads or inherited accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Technology Sales Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 8–10 years of successful B2B technology sales experience, ideally selling enterprise software, SaaS, cloud, data, cybersecurity, or observability solutions to large organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Logo Acquisition Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Evidence of consistently acquiring new customers, penetrating greenfield accounts, and closing complex, high-value enterprise deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Pipeline Generation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability and willingness to prospect, create demand, engage previously untapped stakeholders, and convert cold or early-stage opportunities into qualified pipeline and closed revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience managing multi-stakeholder sales cycles, navigating enterprise procurement processes, negotiating commercial agreements, and closing seven-figure opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication, presentation, negotiation, and relationship-building skills, with the ability to influence senior business and technology decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to uncover business challenges, articulate differentiated value propositions, and build compelling business cases that connect technology investments to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of winning against established competitors, displacing incumbent solutions, and overcoming customer resistance to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory and Account Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong commercial acumen, with the ability to prioritize target accounts, identify buying centers, develop account strategies, and manage a healthy pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to mobilize internal teams and external partners across functions and geographies to progress complex deals and win new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS and Subscription Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with enterprise software licensing, SaaS commercial models, cloud marketplaces, and subscription-based selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter who demonstrates urgency, accountability, curiosity, and persistence in a competitive sales environment. Comfortable creating opportunities where no established customer relationship exists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
